"むしろタグジャンプとかReferencesについてはcoc + αの方が扱いやすいくらいに思ってました","ts":"1624840759.143900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rUN68"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d76cefa0-af97-43c6-b8ad-a086e29fe30c","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"あー、なるほど、確かに","ts":"1624840733.143000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4CU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1931be91-459c-4490-a425-fe5882c2f67b","type":"message","user":"U7CJ2P52B","text":"「一瞬では無理そう」なので一先ずVSCode で始めたんですよね","ts":"1624840726.142800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eH8/X"}]},{"client_msg_id":"282cd824-e0a7-4ce6-a7b8-0aa3e306b4b0","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"自分はその辺Neovimでもあまり困っていなかった・・・","ts":"1624840679.141700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6EXtv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a6ee40f0-949b-407e-9a9a-fd8c726755ad","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"\u0026gt; VSCode だと一瞬でIDEのごとくTSが扱える\nVimでも同レベルのことできません？","ts":"1624840666.141300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8O8rk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c05f74de-d97c-4526-88cd-0cf58f8c5c5b","type":"message","user":"U7CJ2P52B","text":"で、そのままVSCode でぼちぼち書いてきてるんですが、やっぱりVimの方がいいなと","ts":"1624840584.140300","edited":{"user":"U7CJ2P52B","ts":"1624840641.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RFq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"05988648-f101-4a00-967d-c6a54bb3556c","type":"message","user":"U7CJ2P52B","text":"カラースキームがピンとくるのがない、白背景だと数少ないので色味が似ててもハイライトパターンが違うとか（目に馴染まない）\nコードウィンドウ内はほぼVimキーバインドだけど、それ以外にコマンド叩いたりファイラー、Git周りはGUI操作が要る（手が慣馴染まない）\nしかし、VSCode だと一瞬でIDEのごとくTSが扱えるのは素晴らしいですね。","ts":"1624840563.139800","edited":{"user":"U7CJ2P52B","ts":"1624840624.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YRKM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6a3262ff-9db6-4ecb-bac0-911f85cd3f1a","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"自分はVimでしか書いてないから分からないですけど、VSCodeとVimで結構変わります？","ts":"1624840346.136100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0bSP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d79977ec-30eb-487d-babf-e80fe42e5546","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"TSX全部Vimでやってる","ts":"1624840336.135700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bmNH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4e40ef38-6c4e-4f3a-bd26-49a81574c392","type":"message","user":"U7CJ2P52B","text":"ちょっと話は遡るんですが、テンプレート言語系は微妙に微妙なところでてきますよね。\nReactの ts/js 書いてると、VSCodeだとしっくりこないのでNeoVimできっちり環境作ろうかと。\n（微妙に微妙 → 実用上の問題はないけど、どうも見た目と手に馴染まない）","ts":"1624840232.135200","edited":{"user":"U7CJ2P52B","ts":"1624840294.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EtDek"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7e12a3bb-a7b9-45ed-900c-1a6962a31b72","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"PHPer さんに PHPStorm をおすすめしてあげてください","ts":"1624868155.159900","thread_ts":"1624844977.156600","parent_user_id":"U7TMPGWJ0","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"U4/"}]}]
